{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The adhesive-lined heat shrink assortment fits my wire connector purchase because it would help insulate and seal those connections while giving me several sizes to work with.",
    "The super glue offers a useful complement to my duct tape and vinyl cement for small rigid repairs that need a different kind of bond."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The large single-size tubing and hundred-pack of nuts require dimensions I have not established for a current project, so their repair用途 alone does not make them useful purchases now.",
    "The tap wrench, feeler gauge and polishing wheels assume specific threading, clearance-measuring or polishing tasks that my history does not establish.",
    "The examination gloves do not address a clear current need, and I cannot tell whether the extra-large size would fit me."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My purchases of repair supplies seem to have been taken as interest in almost any specialized workshop tool, even when it serves a different task.",
    "Several wire-insulation options fit the same possible need, but I would choose one suitable assortment rather than buy multiple alternatives."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection between my crimp terminals and tubing that insulates and seals those connections matters more to me than a broad resemblance to other repair supplies.",
    "A useful tool is not necessarily an immediate purchase: a caliper could help measure hoses and fittings, but I would wait until a project requires that precision.",
    "Exact dimensions matter for tubing and threaded hardware; without a matching repair in mind, a fixed size or large quantity is difficult to justify."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly understood my practical repair needs but stretched that interest into specialized tools and supplies without a clear task or fit."
}"}
